# m6_identity: a long god-mode run (debug_god at 31: hits are ignored, so the run is
# deterministic for 12000 updates) through two stages and their bosses with every weapon at
# high level, three forks and three hold-B rewinds. Input: A at 30, still fire 60..239, then
# m2_play's sweep (up 40 / hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20) to 12000, B held 5100..5119,
# 7000..7019 and 10500..10529. debug_history_check (0 = the world rebuilt from keyframe +
# input log is identical, every field) is checked with ghosts, beams, seekers and crates in
# flight, on held frames and on the first frames after each release; it is 0 on every frame
# from 31 on (checked frame by frame when re-pinned for M7; the pins are a sample).
# Re-pinned for M7 (formation and beetle drops, ghosts fire level-1 volleys, four stages):
# weapon (kind * 10 + level, F 0, A 1, B 2) F2 at 900, F3 1653, A3 2419 (swap), F3 2593, F4
# 3265, F5 3696 (5-way with the rng jitter: the one weapon that draws from the rng), A5 4449
# (swap, level kept), B5 9076. Forks at 2065, 3193 and 3969 (3 ghosts). The Heisenbug's
# clear at 5925 (stage 2 from there), the Mandelbug's at 11920 (stage 3); the shield (5359)
# is never used up under god mode.
# - 4000: F5 with jitter and three ghosts. 5000: A5 (3 beams), the Heisenbug fight.
# - Hold 1: 5100 (first held frame, game tick 5067) .. 5119 (tick 5029, fuel 140); 5120 is
#   the release (no tick), 5121 the first live tick.
# - Hold 2: 7000 .. 7019, release 7020, live 7021 (stage 2).
# - 9500: B5 seekers from the ship and three ghosts' level-1 seekers (more than 30 bolts).
# - Hold 3: 10500 .. 10529 (tick 10287, fuel 120), release 10530, live 10531: it goes back
#   past the Mandelbug's spawn (10492), which comes again at 10583. 11999 is the last update.
--frames 12000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_stage_clears,debug_world_size --at "2300 debug_forks == 1" --at "2300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3600 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4448 debug_weapon == 5" --at "4449 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5100 debug_state == 5" --at "5100 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5110 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5119 debug_state == 5" --at "5119 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5120 debug_state == 1" --at "5120 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5121 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3968 debug_forks == 2" --at "3969 debug_forks == 3" --at "9075 debug_weapon == 15" --at "9076 debug_weapon == 25" --at "9500 debug_bolts > 30" --at "9500 debug_history_check == 0" --at "6300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7000 debug_state == 5" --at "7010 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7019 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7020 debug_state == 1" --at "7020 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7021 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "9000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4000 debug_weapon == 5" --at "4000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5925 debug_stage_clears == 1" --at "10000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10500 debug_state == 5" --at "10515 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10529 debug_fuel == 120" --at "10529 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10530 debug_state == 1" --at "10530 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10531 debug_history_check == 0" --at "11999 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_forks == 3" --expect "debug_weapon == 25" --expect "debug_stage_clears == 2" --expect "debug_state == 1"
